# Environment

# LaTeX (root-level artifacts from prfaq.tex compilation)
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc

# MCP (project-local, not part of plugin distribution)
.mcp.json

# The sibling lock a punt CLI takes before mutating a shared host file
# (tool-enable-disable.md 2.4). Per-machine runtime state, and it persists by
# design — unlinking a lock file races the next writer. The pattern is broad
# because the lock is named for its host file and tools differ on the suffix:
# both .CLAUDE.md.lock and .CLAUDE.md.punt-import.lock occur. Mirrors the same
# rule in punt-labs/team; a submodule's .gitignore does not govern this repo.
.*.lock

# Deprecated tooling
.claude-flow/

# OS
.DS_Store

# Claude Code (settings.json is tracked; everything else is local/runtime).
# Use `.claude/*`, not `.claude/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so the `!` line below is dead against a bare `.claude/`.
# But a mid-pattern slash anchors to this directory, so `.claude/*` covers only
# the root one where bare `.claude/` covered every depth; `*/**/.claude/`
# restores that. Nested .claude dirs hold settings.local.json, which carries
# machine-local MCP config and absolute-path allow rules — never commit it.
*/**/.claude/
docs/fuzz.sty
docs/*.mf
docs/*.pk
docs/*.tfm
docs/*.aux
docs/*.log
docs/*.fuzz
docs/*.toc
docs/*.out
docs/*.pdf
docs/*.synctex.gz

# Scratch/temp directory (TMPDIR set via .envrc)

# Plugin runtime state (tts, vox, quarry, lux)
.tts/

# Ethos registry (vendored, project-local). This repo has NO submodule at
# .punt-labs/ethos (see CLAUDE.md, "No Git Submodules"). The source registry
# — identities, roles, teams, personalities, writing-styles, talents, and the
# generated agents/ — is tracked so the team is reproducible from a clean
# clone ("ethos is the source, regeneratable at any time"). This matches the
# vendoring model used by the sibling tool repos (vox, lux) after the
# punt-labs/team registry was retired. The plugin ships from the `plugin/`
# subdir via git-subdir, so tracking the registry never reaches plugin users.
#
# Ignored below: upstream dev scaffolding that rode along with the registry,
# and per-machine runtime state (missions/sessions/locks are local audit
# logs, 0700 dirs) that must never enter git.
.punt-labs/ethos/.github/
.punt-labs/ethos/.claude/
.punt-labs/ethos/.biff
.punt-labs/ethos/.gitignore
.punt-labs/ethos/.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc
.punt-labs/ethos/.markdownlint.jsonc
.punt-labs/ethos/CHANGELOG.md
.punt-labs/ethos/README.md
.punt-labs/ethos/missions/
.punt-labs/ethos/missions.jsonl
.punt-labs/ethos/sessions/
.punt-labs/ethos/locks/
.punt-labs/ethos/trace/
.punt-labs/ethos/audit/
.punt-labs/ethos/.create.lock
.punt-labs/ethos/**/.create.lock
# Defense-in-depth: a credential overlay or local-state file must never be
# committed even if an older ethos binary writes it directly under the
# vendored tree instead of .punt-labs/local/ethos/. These patterns are
# belt-and-suspenders over the directory ignores above; the DES-079 storage
# contract already routes this churn to .punt-labs/local/ethos/ (ignored).
.punt-labs/ethos/**/*.local.yaml
.punt-labs/ethos/**/*.lock
.punt-labs/ethos/**/*.audit.jsonl

# Dev scratch files
*.tmp
hook-feedback.md
conv.json
docs/plan-audio-notifications.md
mcp-message/
scripts/demo.md
scripts/quarry-statusline.sh
scripts/test-talk-e2e.sh
Lux.ini

# Local uv overrides (depot find-links, etc.)
uv.toml

# ethos: shared machine-local zone (never track)
